ions of Warm Plate and Bastion Heart. They raise your max HP while placed, and the bonus lasts as long as they stay there (it does not keep growing every turn). The Piggy Bank description now shows how much it earns per win (2G).","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:11:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031142","verified_at":"2026-10-22T07:11:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5049590-1846651706686083","game_id":"steam-5049590","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.2.3: Play Waves 1–10","summary":"The Packfall Chain Arena demo has been updated to version 0.2.3. The demo now runs from wave 1 to wave 10, and battles have been reworked so you can dig into each fight. What's new Play waves 1–10 — Waves 7–10 join the original waves 1–6. In the last four waves, elite versions of the enemies from waves 1–6 appear: the Rune Mage, Diamond Turtle, Shadow Raider, and Magma Golem. Defeat the tenth enemy to conquer Rank V. Reworked battles — The longer your chain, the more the effects of your gear gro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:58:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5049590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:47Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5049590":"2026-10-26T07:37:47Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5049590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:47Z"},"5304430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:37:47Z","last_success_at":"20